# --- Defense-in-depth: NEVER commit per-instance secrets/data (public repo) ---
# Storage dirs are normally stora/ storb/ storage/ (above), but also guard the
# generated artifact names directly, in case an instance is created in-repo
# under a non-standard name (e.g. `retalert --storage ./mytest`). The `identity`
# blob and the rns/ store hold PRIVATE KEYS.
identity
rns/
lxmf/
keys.json
inbox.json
contacts.json
presets.json
groups.json
settings.json
alerts.json
starred.json
shared_instance.json